# Allowlist: the bot image needs only requirements.txt and bot/.
# Everything else stays out of the build context: .env, secrets/, data/, state/,
# tg-bot-api/, .git, .idea, docs, the other images' sources.
*
!requirements.txt
!bot

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
